      "message": "We have bunch of new behaviour which remains untested. The existing tests cover the losing race well. Could we also cover the mirror case, where the listener is registered after the peer - i.e. registerPeerAddedListener replaying already-registered peers? That is the other half of the fix. A case asserting initializeRibOut is never called for a PeerRole.Internal peer, and one asserting LocRibWriter.close() closes the listener registration, would also be cheap here.",
